Add Yan Long section to admin dashboard

- /admin/yanlong/reservations — booking requests from yanlongphuket.com
- /admin/yanlong/inquiries — general contact messages
- /api/admin/yanlong — CRUD endpoint for contact_submissions scoped to source='yanlong'
- Sidebar: new Yan Long section with Reservations + Inquiries links
- DB migration: adds source (text) and metadata (jsonb) columns to
  contact_submissions, plus RLS insert policy for public form submissions
- scripts/apply-yanlong-migration.mjs verifies the migration and runs a
  round-trip insert/delete test
